    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/62/Libertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506233715\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Libertiaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/6/62/Libertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240506233715\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"944\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Libertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Libertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSymphony Traveler\u003c/b\u003e\nA young girl who travels from land to land as a bard.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe plays soothing music with her favorite instrument, which she has with her at all times. Animals always tends to aproach and sorround her because of her music.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1a/SLibertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506233714\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"SLibertiaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1a/SLibertiaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506233714\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"853\" height=\"2209\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SLibertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SLibertiaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/9/9c/Libertia_Symphony_Traveler_Dancer_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260117003310\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Libertia Symphony Traveler Dancer Queen\u0026#39;s Bla